      "id": "kc-children",
      "paraphrase": "KingComments 接著說，在父母的回答裡聽得出感恩和讚嘆。",
      "quote": "The children will ask about the meaning of the celebration of the Passover.",
      "quoteZh": "兒女會問守逾越節是什麼意思。",
